  "prefLabel": "He-W 750.01 Actions Because of Delayed Eligibility Determinations",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-08-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 750.01 Actions Because of Delayed Eligibility Determinations. Pursuant to 7 CFR 273.2(h)(3)(i), if the department has not taken all required actions to determine eligibility within the first 30 days from date of application and the household has not provided all required verification, the household shall be allowed an additional 30 days from the initial request for the verification to provide the verification that is missing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for He-W 700) #5133, eff 5-2-91; ss by #6507, INTERIM, eff 5-1-97, EXPIRES: 8-29-97; ss by #6549, eff 8-1-97; ss by #8388, eff 7-8-05; ss by #10368, eff 7-8-13; ss by #13591, eff 4-24-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w700.html"
